{"pin":"BH00056","subcodes":[{"code":"BH00056","anchor":"","first_line":"God, no God is there but Him, Who speaketh in all things. Verily, there is none other God but Him. His is the glory and the majesty [3.5s]... ...Soon will the cry, 'Yea, yea, here am I, here am I' be heard from every land. For there hath never been, nor can there ever be, any other refuge to fly to for anyone","first_line_orig":"الله لا اله الا هو الذی ینطق فیکل شیء انه لا اله الا هو له العزه و الجلال  ","language":"mixed","word_count":"5660","translations":[],"writing_refs":[{"type":"tablets","type_name":"Tablets of Bahá'u'lláh","language":"orig","lang_name":"Original"},{"type":"tablets","type_name":"Tablets of Bahá'u'lláh","language":"fa","lang_name":"Persian"}],"refs":[{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA27:147","source":"INBA27","locator":"147","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba-v027/?page=75"},{"kind":"publication","code":"BRL_DA#085","source":"BRL_DA","locator":"085","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/156633654"},{"kind":"publication","code":"KHAF.035x","source":"KHAF","locator":"035x","url":"https://bahai-library.com/bahailib/635.pdf#page=35"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MAS4.359bx","source":"MAS4","locator":"359bx","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/b/MAS4/mas4-359.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"PYK.186","source":"PYK","locator":"186","url":"https://bahai-library.com/bahailib/1484.pdf#page=203"},{"kind":"publication","code":"RHQM1.214-214 (271x) (162-162x)","source":"RHQM1","locator":"214-214 (271x) (162-162x)","url":"https://bahai-library.com/bahailib/652.pdf#page=119"},{"kind":"publication","code":"TZH4.212-213x","source":"TZH4","locator":"212-213x","url":"http://www.h-net.org/~bahai/arabic/vol2/tzh4/tzh4.htm"},{"kind":"translation","code":"ADJ.081-082x","source":"ADJ","locator":"081-082x","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/870900014"}]}]}
